        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n1 2\n9 11",
        "output": "1\n541416750",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nFor the first question:\n(A1)A2=12=1.(A_1)^{A_2}=1^2=1.(A1​)A2​=12=1.\n\n\nFor the second question:\n(A9)A10⋅(A9)A11=9101⋅9111≡541416750(mod109+7).(A_9)^{A_{10}}\\cdot (A_9)^{A_{11}}=9^{101}\\cdot 9^{111}\\equiv 541416750 \\pmod{10^9+7}.(A9​)A10​⋅(A9​)A11​=9101⋅9111≡541416750(mod109+7)."
      }
    ]
